  "rawText": "—\n\n-Eulilla (Leah) Goings Francis\n\nDate of Birth: April 16, 1916\nPlace of Birth: Enfield, North Carolina\n\nWWW\n\nMother’s Name: Minnie Wade Goings\nFather’s Name: Ambrose Henry Goings\nBirth Order: Second child of ten children\n\nOccupation: Seamstress\nLikes: Traveling, oratorical contests, good singing\n\nDislikes: Liars, theives, disrespect for elderly\n\nFamily Relationship: Wife of Eddie Rufus Francis, sr.\n\nSV WQWN\n\nFavorite Motto: “You are NEVER too old to learn.”\nI got my first public job at 58 years old, got my drivers licenses at\n60 years old and purchased my first car at 61 years old.\n\nAspirations: To live to a ripe old age, continue in good health, and to let GOD\ncontinue to use my life as an example of how he will bless you when you\n\nlive a life of honesty and righteousness.",
  "cleanedText": "—\n\n-Eulilla (Leah) Goings Francis\n\nDate of Birth: April 16, 1916\nPlace of Birth: Enfield, North Carolina\n\nWWW\n\nMother’s Name: Minnie Wade Goings\nFather’s Name: Ambrose Henry Goings\nBirth Order: Second child of ten children\n\nOccupation: Seamstress\nLikes: Traveling, oratorical contests, good singing\n\nDislikes: Liars, theives, disrespect for elderly\n\nFamily Relationship: Wife of Eddie Rufus Francis, sr.\n\nSV WQWN\n\nFavorite Motto: “You are NEVER too old to learn.”\nI got my first public job at 58 years old, got my drivers licenses at\n60 years old and purchased my first car at 61 years old.\n\nAspirations: To live to a ripe old age, continue in good health, and to let GOD\ncontinue to use my life as an example of how he will bless you when you\n\nlive a life of honesty and righteousness.",
  "confidence": 275.5,
